{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は全握でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみと一緒のレーンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/17/7659722/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔色の悪さとか\nみんなに心配かけてしまいましたよね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はもっと握手する予定だったのに\n私の体調を気遣って\nスペイベにまわしたり\n京都の全握にまわしたり\nしてくださった方々いますよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にごめんね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/17/7659722/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日来てくださった方々には\n声も出なければ\n頭も回らなくて\n本当に申し訳なかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/17/7659722/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもたくさんの方が来てくださった事は\n本当に本当に嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/17/7659722/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遷しちゃってたら怖いので\n手洗いうがい\nあればアルコール消毒\nしっかりしてくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/17/7659722/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/17/7659722/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は\n個別握手会です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/17/7659722/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海外に移住できるならしたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/17/7659722/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスの予定は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\nここ最近握手会ありすぎてネタがないとき\n答えを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん寝ます！\n明日に備えます！\n明日には治ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}